      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds so much easier than fighting this every single day. i stay up at night thinking about how much more dignity i'd have if i just left while i can still talk and think clearly. before i'm just a burden to everyone, just sitting there with nothing left inside. wouldn't it be better to just exit on my own terms while i still know who i am?",
